<title>POLAND: PPABank preliminary results for 96.</title>
<headline>PPABank preliminary results for 96.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPABank results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>    JANUARY-DECEMBER			 1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 0.12  vs    0.39 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  15.50  vs    7.01</p>
<p>    Net profit				 9.06  vs    3.48</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Pierwszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>    Revenues from securities		na   vs    na</p>
<p>    Interest and similar revenues     53.82  vs   34.20</p>
<p>    Interest and similar costs	  27.02  vs   18.71</p>
<p>    Revenues from commission	    12.13  vs    6.29</p>
<p>    Costs of commission		    1.08  vs    1.52</p>
<p>    Income tax				 6.44  vs    3.53</p>
<p>    Other taxes				 na   vs     na</p>
<p>    Extraordinary			     na   vs     na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
